OL,3,GNEWSA'They didn't see it coming' - what
OL,4,Adoes it take to be a traitor?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Minah Shannon felt the tap on her
OL,7,Fshoulder to signify that she had been
OL,8,Fselected as a traitor in series three
OL,9,Fof the popular BBC show, she almost
OL,10,Fstruggled to contain her excitement.
OL,12,F"I literally could have done a back
OL,13,Fflip. I was so excited," she says.
OL,15,FBut thankfully the mum, from Liverpool,
OL,16,Fwas able to maintain her composure to
OL,17,Fmake sure she went undetected until the
OL,18,Ffinal week.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
