OL,3,GNEWSA'They didn't see it coming' - what
OL,4,Adoes it take to be a traitor?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHosted by Claudia Winkleman, The
OL,7,FTraitors sees contestants split into
OL,8,F"faithfuls" and "traitors", with the
OL,9,Fformer looking to find the latter
OL,10,Fbefore they are murdered or banished.
